   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Coffee keeps upsetting my stomach, but I really don't want to quit.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "block": "coffee.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's frustrating. Do you usually drink it on an empty stomach, first thing in the morning?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yep. Before breakfast, always.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "block": "coffee.dlg10",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That might be part of it. Try having it with or after some food, even a piece of toast can help a lot.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "coffee.dlg10"
  },
